{"bookId": "CB_2sB8Ot8RpGZt6in6gX7QI4L1", "title": "Stoner", "bookmarks": {"synckey": 1704213477, "updated": [{"bookId": "CB_2sB8Ot8RpGZt6in6gX7QI4L1", "bookmarkId": "CB_2sB8Ot8RpGZt6in6gX7QI4L1_16_58431-58477", "createTime": 1704213477, "range": "58431-58477", "markText": "\"It isn't a matter of my saving face, Gordon.\"", "colorStyle": 3, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 16}, {"bookId": "CB_2sB8Ot8RpGZt6in6gX7QI4L1", "bookmarkId": "CB_2sB8Ot8RpGZt6in6gX7QI4L1_11_38199-38590", "createTime": 1703946493, "range": "38199-38590", "markText": "Thus for more than a year William kept the house and cared for two helpless people. He was up before dawn, grading papers and preparing lectures; before going to the University he fed Grace, prepared breakfast for himself and Edith, and fixed a lunch for himself, which he took to school in his briefcase. After his classes he came back to the apartment, which he swept, dusted, and cleaned.", "colorStyle": 3, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 11}, {"bookId": "CB_2sB8Ot8RpGZt6in6gX7QI4L1", "bookmarkId": "CB_2sB8Ot8RpGZt6in6gX7QI4L1_9_16210-17251", "createTime": 1703689231, "range": "16210-17251", "markText": "Still smiling and ironically malevolent, he turned to Stoner. \"Nor do you escape, my friend. No indeed. Who are you? A simple son of the soil, as you pretend to yourself? Oh, no. You, too, are among the infirm--you are the dreamer, the madman in a madder world, our own midwestern Don Quixote without his Sancho, gamboling under the blue sky. You're bright enough--brighter anyhow than our mutual friend. But you have the taint, the old infirmity. You think there's something here, something to find. Well, in the world you'd learn soon enough. You, too, are cut out for failure; not that you'd fight the world. You'd let it chew you up and spit you out, and you'd lie there wondering what was wrong. Because you'd always expect the world to be something it wasn't, something it had no wish to be. The weevil in the cotton, the worm in the beanstalk, the borer in the corn. You couldn't face them, and you couldn't fight them; because you're too weak, and you're too strong. And you have no place to go in the world.\"", "colorStyle": 3, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 9}, {"bookId": "CB_2sB8Ot8RpGZt6in6gX7QI4L1", "bookmarkId": "CB_2sB8Ot8RpGZt6in6gX7QI4L1_9_4249-4445", "createTime": 1703588932, "range": "4249-4445", "markText": "He had expected his dismissal and in some ways he welcomed it; but for a moment after it happened he had a twinge of panic. It was as if the last tie between himself and the old life had been cut.", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 9}], "removed": [], "chapters": [{"title": "X", "chapterUid": 16, "chapterIdx": 16}, {"title": "V", "chapterUid": 11, "chapterIdx": 11}, {"title": "II", "chapterUid": 9, "chapterIdx": 9}], "book": {"bookId": "CB_2sB8Ot8RpGZt6in6gX7QI4L1", "version": 589797321, "format": "epub", "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "cover": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wrepub/CB_BRaFAoF7g0Rx6i56gjAvhCw1_parsecover", "title": "Stoner", "author": "John Williams", "coverBoxInfo": {"colorsPure": ["#93B0DA", "#98B8DD"]}}}, "reviews": {"reviews": [{"reviewId": "17408780_7O2hcI2g5", "review": {"bookId": "CB_2sB8Ot8RpGZt6in6gX7QI4L1", "content": "Then how did Edith know? There is an affair between Golden and Edith.", "bookVersion": 589797321, "range": "51852-52031", "abstract": "\"I know,\" Stoner said. \"It doesn't matter. Has the word got around?\"\nFinch shook his head. \"Not yet.\"", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 1, "chapterUid": 22, "reviewId": "17408780_7O2hcI2g5", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1704590832, "flag": 8, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "CB_2sB8Ot8RpGZt6in6gX7QI4L1", "format": "epub", "version": 589797321, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wrepub/CB_BRaFAoF7g0Rx6i56gjAvhCw1_parsecover", "title": "Stoner", "author": "John Williams", "payType": 134217761}, "chapterIdx": 22, "chapterTitle": "XVI", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7NZWt5AH1", "review": {"bookId": "CB_2sB8Ot8RpGZt6in6gX7QI4L1", "content": "There were two sets of out world and inner world so far. One was the university against outer world, another was their dim apartment against outer world.", "bookVersion": 589797321, "range": "47383-47900", "abstract": "During the late winter and early spring months they found together a quietness they had not had before. As the outer world closed upon them they became less aware of its presence; and their happiness was such that they had no need to speak of it to each other, or even to think of it. In Katherine 'ssmall, dim apartment, hidden like a cave beneath the massive old house, they seemed to themselves to move outside of time, in a timeless universe of their own discovery.", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 1, "chapterUid": 19, "reviewId": "17408780_7NZWt5AH1", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1704458234, "flag": 8, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "CB_2sB8Ot8RpGZt6in6gX7QI4L1", "format": "epub", "version": 589797321, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wrepub/CB_BRaFAoF7g0Rx6i56gjAvhCw1_parsecover", "title": "Stoner", "author": "John Williams", "payType": 134217761}, "chapterIdx": 19, "chapterTitle": "XIII", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7NWJQ6JiY", "review": {"bookId": "CB_2sB8Ot8RpGZt6in6gX7QI4L1", "content": "太可悲了，事业，家庭，女儿都无法给这个男人快乐，可能要排除女儿。", "bookVersion": 589797321, "range": "1416-1552", "abstract": "He was forty-two years old, and he could see nothing before him that he wished to enjoy and little behind him that he cared to remember.", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 1, "chapterUid": 18, "reviewId": "17408780_7NWJQ6JiY", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1704276264, "flag": 8, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "CB_2sB8Ot8RpGZt6in6gX7QI4L1", "format": "epub", "version": 589797321, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wrepub/CB_BRaFAoF7g0Rx6i56gjAvhCw1_parsecover", "title": "Stoner", "author": "John Williams", "payType": 134217761}, "chapterIdx": 18, "chapterTitle": "XII", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7NWJuDZQb", "review": {"bookId": "CB_2sB8Ot8RpGZt6in6gX7QI4L1", "content": "虚无主义", "bookVersion": 589797321, "range": "13304-13602", "abstract": "He took a grim and ironic pleasure from the possibility that what little learning he had managed to acquire had led him to this knowledge: that in the long run all things, even the learning that let him know this, were futile and empty, and at last diminished into a nothingness they did not alter.", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 1, "chapterUid": 17, "reviewId": "17408780_7NWJuDZQb", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1704275947, "flag": 8, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "CB_2sB8Ot8RpGZt6in6gX7QI4L1", "format": "epub", "version": 589797321, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wrepub/CB_BRaFAoF7g0Rx6i56gjAvhCw1_parsecover", "title": "Stoner", "author": "John Williams", "payType": 134217761}, "chapterIdx": 17, "chapterTitle": "XI", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7NWFA3Skl", "review": {"bookId": "CB_2sB8Ot8RpGZt6in6gX7QI4L1", "content": "How an English literature professor be so nonsense?", "bookVersion": 589797321, "range": "2129-2261", "abstract": "But Lomax would not respond to his greeting; he stared coldly and turned his eyes away, as if to say that he would not be appeased.", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 1, "chapterUid": 17, "reviewId": "17408780_7NWFA3Skl", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1704272363, "flag": 8, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "CB_2sB8Ot8RpGZt6in6gX7QI4L1", "format": "epub", "version": 589797321, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wrepub/CB_BRaFAoF7g0Rx6i56gjAvhCw1_parsecover", "title": "Stoner", "author": "John Williams", "payType": 134217761}, "chapterIdx": 17, "chapterTitle": "XI", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.